====Adverb====
{{es-adv}}

# [[ago]], [[has]] [[been]] {{gloss|Note: unlike in English,'' hace ''precedes the number.}}
#: {{ux|es|Él nos visitó '''hace''' tres años.|He visited us three years '''ago'''.}}
#: {{ux|es|'''Hace''' un mes que no te veo.|I haven’t seen you '''in''' a month.}}
#: {{ux|es|Lo compré '''hace poco'''.|I bought it '''not long ago'''.}}
#: (also, the clause may come afterwards with the word [[que]] added)
#: {{ux|es|'''Hace''' dos años que no viajo a Europa.|'''It has been''' two years since I traveled to Europe.}}
#: {{ux|es|'''Hace''' quince años que mis padres se casaron.|'''It has been''' fifteen years since my parents got married.}}

